**Read:** [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), complete feed/preparation and process sections for the chosen metal family; [Metal Recycling: Opportunities, Limits, Infrastructure — UNEP International Resource Panel](../sources/Metal-Recycling-UNEP-IRP.lingua#r_40JXFY43ST442BB8MJEAYJT9N1), the whole product-to-feed characterization and process-context discussion; [Mineralogy and petrology — minerals, crystals, rock processes, and investigation](../../../../nature/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN), reuse mineral hosts, phase/chemical measurements, and process-mineralogy evidence.

Ore-derived intermediates, scrap, dross, dust, sludge, solutions, and internally returned material have different composition, phase association, size/form, moisture, contaminants, and history. A single metal assay cannot establish how a feed will react, melt, dissolve, separate, or affect final product quality.

Connect sampling support and analytical methods with the proposed process. Element hosts, oxide/sulfide/metallic state, surface coatings, organics, entrained material, and particle/phase associations may control recovery or residuals. Different bulk compositions can behave similarly, while feeds with similar bulk assays can require different treatment.

Preserve provenance, batch/domain identity, preparation, inventory, and uncertainty. Material changed by drying, oxidation, mixing, or selective handling is not automatically represented by an earlier sample. Recycled feed needs a positive material/quality account and appropriate professional handling; a scrap label does not identify every included substance or object.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete mineral-derived and a secondary-feed characterization case for the same target product. Compare analytical support, phase/physical evidence, expected process response, and uncertainties. Explain which observation most affects route choice and which property is still inaccessible. Design a representative characterization campaign that could reject the convenient assumption that the two feeds are interchangeable.

**Continue:** [Translate a useful metal product into composition, structure, form, and test evidence](Usable-metal-product-specifications-and-evidence.lingua#r_1XE5CFK55A0FXE6NMYC52D07MC).

